sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Cause form
    participant CC as Causes Controller
    participant CA as SQL table: causes

    Admin->>UI: Click New Cause
    UI-->>Admin: Show create-cause form
    Admin->>UI: Enter name, description, TRS flag and active status
    UI->>UI: Validate required fields
    UI->>CC: Submit new cause
    CC->>CC: Validate cause data
    CC->>CA: Insert new cause
    CA-->>CC: Saved cause
    CC-->>UI: Creation success
    UI->>CC: Refresh cause list
    CC->>CA: Read causes
    CA-->>CC: Updated list
    CC-->>UI: Updated list
    UI-->>Admin: Close form and show new cause

    alt Invalid data or save error
        UI-->>Admin: Show validation or creation error
    end
